    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105338" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρί-τομος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thrice-cut,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12.314.108
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίτομον, τό,</span>
			<i>a kind of tunny,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Xenocr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				2.58.139
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				32.151
			</span></i>; =
			<i>tricodatum, Gloss.;</i> also an object of value, used as a
			bribe (exact sense uncertain), <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				62.12
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>, cf. Wilcken ad loc.).</div>
